  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Christopher J. Mahoney said artificial intelligence and algorithmic-derived systems are not far behind cyber in becoming part of the normal warfighting domain. He also said that capability must be brought in and made a normal part of programmatics. In August 2026, Mahoney said data should be treated as \"our jet fuel.\"",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s4"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Christopher J. Mahoney said artificial intelligence and algorithmic-derived systems are not far behind cyber in becoming part of the normal warfighting domain.",
